/* SwiftVR (one-step VSR) upscaler: VideoUpscale.swift, H3VSR.swift */
"SwiftVR（AI動画超解像・研究用）" = "SwiftVR (AI video super-resolution, research)";
"動画全体を一度に見るAIモデル（SwiftVR、Wan2.2ベース）で、質感や細部を描き起こしながら拡大します。24フレームずつ処理し、Real-ESRGANより大幅に時間がかかります（M5で5秒の動画に1分前後）。重みはSwiftVR Research License（研究・非商用）のため同梱せず、ダウンロードした重みをアプリで変換して使います。" = "An AI model that looks at the whole video at once (SwiftVR, based on Wan2.2) enlarges it while drawing texture and detail back in. It works 24 frames at a time and takes far longer than Real-ESRGAN (about a minute for a 5-second video on an M5). Its weights are under the SwiftVR Research License (research, non-commercial), so they are not bundled: the app converts weights you downloaded.";
"このMacでは使えません。" = "Not available on this Mac.";
